      <h1>Cloud Media Downloader v1.0</h1>
      <h4 class="description">
        An automated media ingestion and library management tool that fetches content from Google Drive, direct web
        links, and BitTorrent magnet links directly to your server.
      </h4>
      <h5> -> Equipped with <strong>built-in ZIP extraction</strong> and <strong>FileBot metadata matching</strong>, it automatically renames and
        organizes your Movies, TV Series, and Anime into clean, Jellyfin-ready folders
